  "notes": "Use the standard Reset-dialog style for the Help Back control: square blue-gray selected fill, neutral corner focus marks and the existing device font. Remove the unique gold rounded control.\n\nKeep Back focused immediately; preserve the QR fade/slide, physical-left return and down-hold curtain dismissal. QR size, quiet zone and white-on-dark rendering are unchanged.\n\nValidation: three focused host suites, independent review, checked build and USB install; six CRC-verified device frames from both passive failure-to-QR paths, with the standard control visibly selected. Startup retained successful BLE/Twin connection even when Wi-Fi association was unavailable. Flashlight learning was preserved. Full physical input/load/phone acceptance remains separate.\n",
